# Level 3: "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 blue and red Otter creature token with
# prowess." The opponent's Bolt is not cast by you and Ornithopter is a creature spell, so neither makes an Otter;
# Ponder (a sorcery) does, and so does a Bolt the opponent counters: the trigger is put on the stack above the spell
# as it is cast, and does not care what becomes of it (CR 603.3b, and the card's ruling).

